<title>GERMANY: Grundig appoints new chief executive.</title>
<headline>Grundig appoints new chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grunding AG, the struggling German electronics group, said on Monday its supervisory board gave final approval to the appointment of Pieter de Jong as chief executive.</p>
<p>The former Grundig finance director replaces Pieter van der Wal, who stepped down on February 3 after the works council had called for his resignation.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
